<!--
    Small icon for the "now playing" notification, the lock screen and the media resumption tile.

    A single opaque silhouette on transparency, because the platform masks a notification's small
    icon to its alpha channel and tints the result: anything with colour or interior detail would be
    thrown away. Headphones rather than the microphone used for new-episode notifications, so the
    two are distinguishable at 24dp in the status bar.
-->
